  "servings": 2,
  "summary": "Reimagine your morning routine with these savory Thai street-style chicken skewers, specially adapted into <b>a energized breakfast plate</b>. Tender strips of chicken thigh are steeped in lemongrass, coconut cream, and garlic before being grilled until lightly charred and juicy. Served alongside warm sticky rice and a quick sunnyside-up fried egg, this morning meal offers a power-packed balance of protein and satisfying complex carbohydrates. A light dipping sauce crafted from roasted peanuts, red curry paste, and lime juice provides a savory nuttiness that ties the smoky chicken to the chewy sticky rice. The contrast between soft egg yolk and caramelized grilled meat creates a morning culinary experience that feels both luxurious and authentic. Prepare the bamboo skewers and marinade the night before to ensure effortless morning grilling that takes under ten minutes to complete.",
